  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Gender Based Violence Prevention and Response Project (GBVPR) Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Goal of the project is to reduce all forms of gender-based violence and discrimination against women and girls in 2 provinces in Nepal. To achieve this goal, the project will pursue outcomes in 3 areas: primary prevention through changing social norms at the community level; multi-sectoral, survivor-centered services for survivors; and local and provincial governments adopting and implementing policies and budgets for the promotion of gender equality and the empowerment of all women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
